 Push Shows Companies’ Importance in Global Economic War&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/business/economy/trump-nvidia-national-security-us-economics.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:13:40 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC] 随着英伟达的下滑，纳斯达克指数下跌，回吐了周一的部分涨势：实时更新</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/23/stock-market-today-live-updates.html</link><description>美国股市周二下跌，回吐了前一交易日因黄仁勋重新担任英伟达首席执行官而引发的部分大幅上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/23/stock-market-today-live-updates.html'&gt;随着英伟达的下滑，纳斯达克指数下跌，回吐了周一的部分涨势：实时更新&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq declines as Nvidia slides, giving back part of Monday’s rally: Live updates&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/23/stock-market-today-live-updates.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:20:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 英伟达董事会面临治理问题</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/nvidia-s-board-faces-governance-questions-video</link><description>英伟达董事会在首席执行官黄仁勋短暂离职后将其重新召回，引发了有关公司治理、国家安全和政治影响力的质疑。哈佛大学法学教授杰西·弗里德认为，董事会的决定反映了其对股东的责任，而批评者则警告说，总统的参与可能会开创一个令人不安的先例。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/nvidia-s-board-faces-governance-questions-video'&gt;英伟达董事会面临治理问题&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nvidia’s Board Faces Governance Questions&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/nvidia-s-board-faces-governance-questions-video</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:23:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[金融时报等2家] 随着科技股涨势消退，Anthropic 跌破 IPO 价格</title><link>https://www.ft.com/content/c0cb932a-076e-4471-8009-91749fde5f47?syn-25a6b1a6=1</link><description>英伟达首席执行官情绪低落，黄仁勋复职让投资者松了口气&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 2 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/c0cb932a-076e-4471-8009-91749fde5f47?syn-25a6b1a6=1'&gt;随着科技股涨势消退，Anthropic 跌破 IPO 价格&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Anthropic falls below IPO price as tech rally fades&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[路透社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNMHBNOVY5RDc1NmxUUjNnZkNhLWROQkhUOFZpVmQ0SEI0UG9aSUpTTjhpV3EydTNkdW8xYm1KOWF6OXg2Z3BMaUJCWTE3WnFCM0hCZGNuQ3ZKUklsYUROVWQzdExOamNKVlJLRTgwYWpoYVdOUjlDY0pxTmxZajlvckJ4cHc0TG1hbW1ZUkszaDZ2M2Rvd3RqTWRFaVRENXVWT0pr?oc=5'&gt;Anthropic 创纪录上市后迅速逆转，跌破 83 美元 IPO 价格&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Anthropic falls below $83 IPO price in swift reversal after record listing&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.ft.com/content/c0cb932a-076e-4471-8009-91749fde5f47?syn-25a6b1a6=1</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:26:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 电台播放俄罗斯军队的经典摇滚、怀旧之情以及投降请求</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/world/europe/ukraine-russia-psyops-radio-izium.html</link><description>看似前线的俄罗斯广播电台实际上是乌克兰的一次心理行动，希望在克里姆林宫的士兵中播下绝望的种子。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/world/europe/ukraine-russia-psyops-radio-izium.html'&gt;电台播放俄罗斯军队的经典摇滚、怀旧之情以及投降请求&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Radio Offers Russian Troops Classic Rock, Nostalgia — and Pleas to Surrender&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/world/europe/ukraine-russia-psyops-radio-izium.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:27:03 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[BBC] 印度政府“失去了阴谋”，“蟑螂”领导人被禁止乘坐英国航班</title><link>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm5y1ezx2gqyo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss</link><description>绍拉夫·达斯说，德里机场的移民当局告诉他，他的护照已被标记。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[BBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm5y1ezx2gqyo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss'&gt;印度政府“失去了阴谋”，“蟑螂”领导人被禁止乘坐英国航班&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Indian government has 'lost the plot', says 'cockroach' leader barred from UK flight&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm5y1ezx2gqyo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:37:04 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 顶级策略师称 Nvidia 为“纸牌屋”</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/top-strategist-calls-nvidia-a-house-of-cards-video</link><description>英伟达的反弹可能为人工智能贸易赢得了时间，但数据中心建设的推迟、对价格敏感的需求和日益严格的审查正在引发人们对未来利润的怀疑，Miller Tabak and Co.首席市场策略师兼马利报告创始人马特·马利(Matt Maley)表示。他加入了彭博未平仓合约，讨论了市场对几个关键参与者的依赖，以及为什么循环融资让该行业看起来像纸牌屋。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/top-strategist-calls-nvidia-a-house-of-cards-video'&gt;顶级策略师称 Nvidia 为“纸牌屋”&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Top Strategist Calls Nvidia a House of Cards&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/top-strategist-calls-nvidia-a-house-of-cards-video</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:38:14 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 黄仁勋复职，英伟达 (NVDA) 股价飙升，引发杠杆 ETF 争论</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-24/nvidia-nvda-surging-on-huang-s-reinstatement-brings-back-leveraged-etf-debate</link><description>英伟达股价飙升在杠杆 ETF 投资者中创造了大赢家和输家&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-24/nvidia-nvda-surging-on-huang-s-reinstatement-brings-back-leveraged-etf-debate'&gt;黄仁勋复职，英伟达 (NVDA) 股价飙升，引发杠杆 ETF 争论&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nvidia (NVDA) Surging on Huang’s Reinstatement Brings Back Leveraged ETF Debate&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-24/nvidia-nvda-surging-on-huang-s-reinstatement-brings-back-leveraged-etf-debate</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:42:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC等5家] 黄仁勋将在 Nvidia 在 GTC 上发布新产品的同一天面临 DC 拷问</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/jensen-huang-nvidia-congress-gtc.html</link><description>黄仁勋重新担任英伟达首席执行官，立即面临着领导这家芯片巨头并在华盛顿捍卫自己的挑战。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 5 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/jensen-huang-nvidia-congress-gtc.html'&gt;黄仁勋将在 Nvidia 在 GTC 上发布新产品的同一天面临 DC 拷问&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Jensen Huang to face DC grilling the same day Nvidia releases new products at GTC&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/technology/jensen-huang-nvidia-board-trump.html'&gt;随着黄仁勋重新担任首席执行官，特朗普实际上凌驾于英伟达董事会之上&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：With Jensen Huang’s Return as C.E.O., Trump Effectively Overrode Nvidia’s Board&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[BBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cq5y1k8ez407o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss'&gt;特朗普在表示“说服”英伟达恢复首席执行官黄仁勋后面临强烈反对&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Trump faces backlash after saying he 'convinced' Nvidia to reinstate CEO Jensen Huang&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNN]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPd1B4cC1SU05RbUtUbDZ4aHdNNU44a3I3ZDhCUlRHYnhMMXJPc09DXy1FZFFpSmlMd09OaEZaUHFuWXNXYno3Qzk1YldoclluVnBRaVdscEtNOWRHZldnYmpyRldYUDFhRjdEdVRlQXJRMFB1TEp2TU8tSTAyMTliQmlCRE9rMDFXaWc?oc=5'&gt;共和党因黄仁勋复职英伟达而与特朗普决裂&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Republicans break from Trump over Jensen Huang’s Nvidia reinstatement&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[美联社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNbUdPNnFZNXVRRHJqeGNYX0ptRk1oUW85OHlueHM2aW5teGxVWmViTWdKOGVTTVBYdWNVTjA3M2d4NUFfQ1Fac2g2ZzVZZ0hMdnZ6V1RQdFRmdWNfZlFzNnRYNmR0YWsxUjFIaTNYR2c5V3RQUHdVVUx4X1loaHF6dEcyNF9fQQ?oc=5'&gt;英伟达董事会在拒绝黄仁勋回归首席执行官几天后恢复其首席执行官职务&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nvidia board reinstates Jensen Huang as CEO just days after rejecting his offer to return&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/jensen-huang-nvidia-congress-gtc.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:42:57 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>